  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fight Against Tuberculosis in Tajikistan - Tajikistan (01-Jan-2016-31-Mar-2018)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tajikistan, Tuberculosis, Republican Center of Tuberculosis Control - Tajikistan (RCTC)This program has the following goals: To decrease the burden of tuberculosis in Tajikistan by ensuring universal access to timely and quality diagnosis and treatment of all forms of TB. The objectives of this program are: To enhance the response to TB epidemic by strengthening involvement of communities, advocacy, communication and social mobilization.  To ensure universal access to early and quality diagnosis of all forms of TB including M/XDR-TB.  To ensure universal access to quality patient-centered treatment of all forms of TB including M/XDR-TB with appropriate patient support.  To provide appropriate TB care for high-risk population groups: prisoners and TB/HIV co-infection.  To strengthen the National TB Program management and improve the health system&#x2019;s performance for effective TB control</narrative>
  </description>
